---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | JobAgent"
  description="JobAgent Privacy Policy: how we handle information related to your visit to this website."
>
  <main class="legal">
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="updated">Last updated: September 11, 2026</p>

    <section>
      <h2>1. Overview</h2>
      <p>
        JobAgent (the "Site") is a product introduction website. We respect and protect the privacy of our visitors. This policy explains how information related to your visit is handled. By using the Site you agree to the terms of this policy.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>2. Information We Handle</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>The Site is static, offers no account registration, and does not actively collect personally identifiable information such as names or email addresses.</li>
        <li>The hosting platform (e.g. Cloudflare Pages) may record basic access logs (IP, User-Agent, etc.) under its own policies, outside our control.</li>
        <li>If analytics are enabled in the future, only anonymized usage statistics (page views, referrers, etc.) will be used, never to identify individuals.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>3. Local Storage</h2>
      <p>
        The Site's Demo beta signup form stores the GitHub username you enter in your browser's localStorage (key: <code>jobagent_waitlist</code>). This data is <strong>stored only in your browser locally, never uploaded to any server</strong>, and cannot be accessed by us or any third party. You can clear this data at any time in your browser settings.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>4. Cookies</h2>
      <p>
        The Site does not use cookies for tracking. Only the localStorage described above is used to remember beta signup information, not for cross-site tracking.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>5. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>
        The Site contains links to third-party websites such as GitHub. Their privacy practices are not covered by this policy; please refer to their own policies.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>6. Children</h2>
      <p>The Site is not directed at children under 14, and we do not knowingly collect personal information from them.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>7. Changes</h2>
      <p>
        This policy may be updated as the product evolves. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated revision date.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>8. Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about this policy can be raised via Issues on our
        <a href="https://github.com/bayernjf/job-agent" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub repository</a>.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
